        "TileImage": "$($repository 92d10c94-9f65-4e84-8280-f79d07e120cf).Image",
        "Description": "Have you ever looked at a Hitman NPC and thought: &quot;Man, how I would massacre you if only you weren&apos;t a non target...&quot;? Well then you&apos;ve come to the right place pal! In this contract series I will pick out the most infuriating NPCs in each mission so that you can kill them without regret :)\r\rFun fact: Whittleton Creek&apos;s only real annoying NPC is Gunther. I had to think really hard to come up with anyone who is even a little annoying and Helen I just picked cuz she sucks lol",
